(or cotton exchange, but how does it apply to the Stock Exchange? You) Tj T*
(concede that scientific price-making for commodities like grain and) Tj T*
(cotton is highly necessary, but you do not see that the same necessity) Tj T*
(exists for stocks and bonds. You feel, no doubt, that the one has to) Tj T*
(do with food and raiment and is therefore indispensable, while the) Tj T*
(other merely serves to stimulate speculation and gambling, and hence) Tj T*
