(In 1909 similar criticism in New York having led to the appointment of) Tj T*
(the Hughes Commission to inquire ?what changes, if any, are advisable) Tj T*
(in the laws of the State bearing upon speculation in securities and) Tj T*
(commodities, or relating to the protection of investors, or with) Tj T*
(regard to the instrumentalities and organizations used in dealings in) Tj T*
(securities and commodities, which are the subject of speculation,? the) Tj T*
(commission reported to the Governor, after six months of laborious) Tj T*
