() Tj T*
(  ?Speculation in some form is a necessary incident of productive) Tj T*
(  operation. When carried on in connection with either commodities) Tj T*
(  or securities it tends to steady their prices. Where speculation) Tj T*
(  is free, fluctuations in prices, otherwise violent and disastrous,) Tj T*
(  ordinarily become gradual and comparatively harmless. For the) Tj T*
(  merchant or manufacturer speculation performs a service which has) Tj T*
(  the effect of insurance. The most fruitful policy will be found in) Tj T*
(  measures which will lessen speculation by persons not qualified) Tj T*
(  to engage in it. In carrying out such a policy exchanges can) Tj T*
(  accomplish more than legislation. We are unable to see how a State) Tj T*
(  could distinguish by law between proper and improper transactions,) Tj T*
(  since the forms and the mechanisms used are identical. Rigid) Tj T*
(  statutes directed against the latter would seriously interfere) Tj T*
(  with the former. Purchasing securities on margin is as legitimate) Tj T*
(  a transaction as the purchase of any property in which part) Tj T*
(  payment is deferred. We, therefore, see no reason whatsoever for) Tj T*
(  recommending the radical change suggested that margin trading be) Tj T*
(  prohibited.?) Tj T*
