(splendid work of conquering a continent the Stock Exchange has kept) Tj T*
(pace with the march of industry. It has supplied the one great central) Tj T*
(market for the expression of the country?s progress as measured by) Tj T*
(the country?s securities, and it will continue to do so as long as an) Tj T*
(evergreen faith in America exists among its people.) Tj T*
