(PATRONS OF THE EXCHANGE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The patrons of the Exchange may be divided into the following groups:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(1.\) Investors, who personally examine the facts relating to the) Tj T*
(value of securities or act on the advice of reputable and experienced) Tj T*
(financiers, and pay in full for what they buy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
