(conditions of business, and acquire early information concerning the) Tj T*
(changes which affect the values of securities. From their familiarity) Tj T*
(with the technique of dealings on the Exchange, and ability to act in) Tj T*
(concert with others, and thus manipulate values, they are supposed to) Tj T*
(have special advantages over other traders.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
