() Tj T*
(It is unquestionable that only a small part of the transactions upon) Tj T*
(the Exchange is of an investment character; a substantial part may) Tj T*
(be characterized as virtually gambling. Yet we are unable to see) Tj T*
(how the State could distinguish by law between proper and improper) Tj T*
(transactions, since the forms and the mechanisms used are identical.) Tj T*
(Rigid statutes directed against the latter would seriously interfere) Tj T*
