(tends to restrain inordinate advances. In each case there must be) Tj T*
(a buyer and a seller and the interaction of their trading steadies) Tj T*
(prices. Speculation thus brings into the market a distinct class of) Tj T*
(people possessing capital and special training who assume the risks of) Tj T*
(holding and distributing the proceeds of the crops from one season to) Tj T*
(another with the minimum of cost to producer and consumer.) Tj T*
